176148714_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4tsPQgqWQgcQ7kNvwGwharR&_nc_oc=AdqrFUqARnKe0eNHBwlY3ItDs8Zybq0MpvPwRC3dhSSDnbaiNuhsLO4Uk3EkJlg6lyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLppXSRURaiS-Krialxu70snn6M8UWL7EluL4bp8tdA1w&oe=6AB151F8"}, {"file_name": "nursing_screenshot05.png", "id": "1143507283513545", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982654_1143507286846878_252352450397043439_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v4OqUGZRTJ8Q7kNvwHi5G3t&_nc_oc=AdoVhPj2kfKd-nXnJIJpq443twQ1a70RRbRuLeGBSI_Wr4z06D_MxYxmwUCcavaeeyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJkXUoKVVLdpBHGMw4wGr_8z_ogXCYRWLjAJtybIhdIDA&oe=6AB152F8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nursing_coverImage_2560x1440.png", "id": "751224293868148", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974886_751224297201481_7099546317802772565_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XRkF6mg8KkwQ7kNvwER6ncF&_nc_oc=AdrznKaaiYRZlp8V7_75_QG3I5FBukGHK4gklRYRIvzNduLaLsaxoBjzis5wsiqDsEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL2KCn6KoTVsAGIf-vG_JUrg-Z2VDzQePERmwwPmQ7aLA&oe=6AB1289B"}, "display_name": "AcroXeR NursingVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Training system for medication education\n   - Controller system (order output, object picking, drug mixing, patient administration)\n   - Order (medication order) system\n   - Evaluation system (accuracy of operation, time, sequence, drug mix accuracy)\n\u3147 Educational content\n  - Tutorial: VR device operation\n  - Dosage 1.1 General drug administration \n  - Dosage 1.2 High-risk drug administration \n  - Medication 1.3 Emergency medication administration \n\u3147 System development\n   - System advancement (UI/UX creation, medication order system, evaluation items)\n   - Divided into two modes (training mode, challenge mode)\n   - Pharmaceutical and medical device random p